2° gukurikirana imiyoborere y’Imirenge
igize Akarere;
3° gufata neza ibikorwa remezo biri mu
Karere hakurikijwe ibishushanyo
mbonera n’umurongo ngenderwaho
bitangwa n’Umujyi wa Kigali;
4° gushyira mu bikorwa imishinga
